WEBVTT

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:15.407
Behold. The great lion.

00:00:15.647 --> 00:00:17.167
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:00:28.607 --> 00:00:30.047
(GROWLING)

00:00:30.207 --> 00:00:31.567
(ALL JEERING)

00:00:41.447 --> 00:00:43.367
Do you want some milk?

00:00:44.927 --> 00:00:47.047
Why doesn't he fight back?

00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:49.527
Bind him!

00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:53.367
MAN: Tie him up! Get him!

00:00:58.487 --> 00:00:59.527
(MOANING)

00:00:59.727 --> 00:01:00.807
Wait!

00:01:01.487 --> 00:01:04.087
Let him first be shaved.

00:01:04.327 --> 00:01:06.207
(ALL CHEERING)

00:01:26.407 --> 00:01:28.087
Bring him to me.

00:01:44.607 --> 00:01:47.287
(HOWLING)

00:01:51.407 --> 00:01:53.087
(CROWD SILENCES)

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.767
(ALL CLAMOURING)

00:02:29.287 --> 00:02:30.967
You know, Aslan,

00:02:31.967 --> 00:02:34.447
I'm a little disappointed in you.

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:40.007
Did you honestly think by all this
that you could save the human traitor?

00:02:43.407 --> 00:02:45.847
You are giving me your life

00:02:46.007 --> 00:02:48.327
and saving no one.

00:02:48.487 --> 00:02:49.487
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:51.127 --> 00:02:53.167
So much for love.

00:03:01.567 --> 00:03:03.047
Tonight,

00:03:04.887 --> 00:03:09.487
the Deep Magic will be appeased!

00:03:09.807 --> 00:03:11.327
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:12.927 --> 00:03:14.527
But tomorrow,

00:03:17.047 --> 00:03:19.927
we will take Narnia

00:03:21.127 --> 00:03:27.007
forever!

00:03:30.127 --> 00:03:31.807
In that knowledge,

00:03:32.887 --> 00:03:34.367
despair

00:03:44.527 --> 00:03:46.567
and die!

00:03:46.767 --> 00:03:47.767
(GRUNTS)

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:49.207
(GASPS)

00:03:49.447 --> 00:03:51.727
(GROANING)

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:58.447
(BOTH SOBBING)

00:04:00.127 --> 00:04:02.007
(ALL CHEERING)

00:04:05.607 --> 00:04:07.527
The Great Cat

00:04:07.687 --> 00:04:10.207
is dead!

00:04:13.727 --> 00:04:15.047
General.

00:04:15.647 --> 00:04:18.087
Prepare your troops for battle.

00:04:19.127 --> 00:04:20.607
(ROARING)

00:04:22.007 --> 00:04:24.087
However short it may be.

00:04:28.967 --> 00:04:30.807
(DISTANT HOWLING)

00:05:12.327 --> 00:05:13.887
It's too late.

00:05:15.687 --> 00:05:17.087
He's gone.

00:05:36.847 --> 00:05:39.647
He must have known
what he was doing.

00:06:05.887 --> 00:06:07.967
(SQUEAKING)

00:06:13.087 --> 00:06:16.047
Get away! Get away, all of you!

00:06:16.847 --> 00:06:19.487
No. Look.

